---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: labContent.articles
  size: 1
  alias: article
permalink: "wissen/{{ article.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ article.title }}"
  description: "{{ article.summary }}"
---
<main class="content-detail shell">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/investment-lab.html">Investment Lab</a><span>›</span><a href="/investment-lab.html#wissen">Immobilienwissen</a><span>›</span><span>{{ article.title }}</span></nav>
  <article class="science-article science-article-v2">
    <header class="science-hero">
      <span class="lab-kicker">— {{ article.category }} —</span>
      <h1>{{ article.title }}</h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ article.summary }}</p>
      <p class="content-meta">Fischer &amp; Geserich Real Estate GmbH · aktualisiert {{ article.updated }}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="science-section"><h2>Was der Begriff konkret bedeutet</h2><p>{{ article.definition or article.body }}</p></section>

    {% if article.focusPoints and article.focusPoints.length %}
    <section class="science-section">
      <h2>Was in der Praxis wirklich entscheidend ist</h2>
      <div class="focus-grid">
        {% for point in article.focusPoints %}<div class="focus-point"><span>{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span><p>{{ point }}</p></div>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if article.formulae and article.formulae.length %}
    <section class="science-section"><h2>Rechenlogik</h2><div class="lab-formula-card">{% for formula in article.formulae %}<div class="lab-formula">{{ formula }}</div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if article.example %}
    <section class="lab-example-section science-section"><h2>{{ article.example.title or "Durchgerechnetes Beispiel" }}</h2>
      <div class="lab-example-grid"><div><h3>Annahmen</h3><ul>{% for item in article.example.assumptions %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div><div><h3>Rechnung</h3><ul>{% for item in article.example.steps %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></div>
      {% if article.example.interpretation %}<div class="lab-interpretation"><strong>Einordnung des Ergebnisses</strong><p>{{ article.example.interpretation }}</p></div>{% endif %}
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if article.comparisonTable %}
    <section class="science-section"><h2>{{ article.comparisonTable.title }}</h2><div class="science-table-wrap"><table class="science-table"><thead><tr>{% for h in article.comparisonTable.headers %}<th>{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in article.comparisonTable.rows %}<tr>{% for cell in row %}<td>{{ cell }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>{% if article.comparisonTable.note %}<p class="table-note">{{ article.comparisonTable.note }}</p>{% endif %}</section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if article.timeline %}
    <section class="science-section"><h2>{{ article.timeline.title }}</h2><div class="science-timeline">{% for item in article.timeline.items %}<div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-label">{{ item.label }}</div><div><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.text }}</p></div></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if article.decisionUse %}<section class="science-section decision-section"><span class="lab-kicker">— ENTSCHEIDUNGSRELEVANZ —</span><h2>Was daraus für eine Immobilienentscheidung folgt</h2><p>{{ article.decisionUse }}</p></section>{% endif %}

    {% if article.sources and article.sources.length %}<section class="lab-source-section science-section"><h2>Quellen &amp; Rechtsgrundlagen</h2><ul>{% for source in article.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul><p class="lab-source-note">Rechts-, Steuer- und Förderstände können sich ändern. Maßgeblich ist der Stand im konkreten Einzelfall.</p></section>{% endif %}

    <aside class="article-note"><strong>Hinweis</strong><p>Die Beispiele erläutern die wirtschaftliche Systematik. Sie ersetzen keine individuelle Rechts-, Steuer-, Finanzierungs- oder Anlageberatung.</p></aside>
    <div class="article-actions"><a class="lab-btn lab-btn-gold" href="/investment-lab.html">Im Investment Lab weiterarbeiten</a><a class="lab-btn lab-btn-ghost" href="/ankaufsberatung.html">Ankaufsberatung</a></div>
  </article>
</main>
